0..58 Comment "/// This source states integer addition and its path laws."
59..108 Comment "/// It follows cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/Data/Int`."
109..112 Comment "///"
113..156 Comment "/// The sum recurses on its second summand."
157..228 Comment "/// Zero is a unit, and successor and predecessor move through the sum."
229..232 Comment "///"
233..289 Comment "/// The commutativity proof relates both operand orders."
290..344 Comment "/// The winding-number source uses these integer laws."
345..348 Comment "///"
349..379 Comment "/// - see: #427 — `plusComm`"
381..442 Comment "// The integers, one successor more and one predecessor more."
